an></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">bcb0f46f-6e2d-4d87-ad48-2ed276771928</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:bcb0f46f-6e2d-4d87-ad48-2ed276771928\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:bcb0f46f-6e2d-4d87-ad48-2ed276771928\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the camp of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Filro\" title=\"Filro\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Portrait_Filro.png/25px-Portrait_Filro.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Portrait_Filro.png/38px-Portrait_Filro.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Portrait_Filro.png/50px-Portrait_Filro.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Filro\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Portrait_Filro.png/25px-Portrait_Filro.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/29/Portrait_Filro.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Filro\" title=\"Filro\">Filro</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Dread_Hollow\" title=\"Dread Hollow\">Dread Hollow</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-56&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-161</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[An unfinished conjuration scroll marred by teeth marks and dried slobber. a few words emerge from the muddled:]\n</p><p>Skaeren ixen svel! MAGMA!\n</p><p>Magma\n</p><p>MagmaMAGMA\n</p><p>MAG MAmagma\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scribbled_Notes\" title=\"Scribbled Notes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scribbled_Notes\" title=\"Scribbled Notes\">Scribbled Notes</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202535\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2307/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33460/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8652/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1040117/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   55.136      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   55.136      1 -total\n 48